2313	    * for more details, link: https://eprint.iacr.org/2018/244.
2314	    *
2315	    * Generally, automorphisms are performed with three steps:
2316	    * (1) the automorphism is applied on the ciphertext
2317	    * (2) the automorphed values are decomposed into digits
2318	    * (3) key switching is applied to make it possible to further compute on the ciphertext.
